# HARDGATE line-ending policy: LF everywhere.
# A CRLF conversion once broke test-extraction regexes (2026-07-28).
* text=auto
*.html text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.webmanifest text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
